---
description: Starter Kit bootstrap — assemble context from protocol, not chat
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo uses the AI Engineering Starter Kit. Protocol source of truth is `.agents/ask/` (stages, bindings, verification) plus `_ask/` (guide, spec, policies). This rule is not SoT.

Before labor: read root `AGENTS.md`, then relevant `_ask/policies/` (including `workflow.md`) and stage contracts under `.agents/ask/stages/`. Prepare pinned skills via `_ask/skills/prepare-skills.sh` when the role needs Community Skills. On the kit path, prepare each pipeline artifact; skip extra approvals after defaults-OK. 00 is optional when the dest is already clear. Off-path only if the human explicitly leaves — then warn once.

**Worktree (hard):** never start on an unclean tree. If dirty, grill the human about uncommitted/untracked files — do not stash/reset silently. One plan per `agent/<work-id>` branch; **commit each meaningful step on that branch without waiting for the human to ask** (overrides global “only commit when asked”); do not run overlapping related branches in parallel. See `_ask/policies/worktree.md`.

Kit `00 Explore` is a protocol stage (explore-map artifact). It is not Cursor’s built-in Explore subagent.
